sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Client
    participant MW as AuthMiddleware (HTTP layer)
    participant CTRL as Controller
    participant UC as Use-Case (core)

    U->>MW: Request + identity header (e.g. x-user-id / mock token)
    MW->>MW: resolve header → lookup user record
    alt identity not recognized
        MW-->>U: 401 Unauthorized
    else identity recognized
        MW->>MW: build AuthenticatedUser { id, role }
        MW->>CTRL: forward request + AuthenticatedUser
        CTRL->>UC: execute(dto, AuthenticatedUser)
        Note over UC: Authorization (role check)<br/>happens HERE, inside the use-case,<br/>NOT in middleware
        alt role not permitted for this operation
            UC-->>CTRL: throws UnauthorizedError
            CTRL-->>U: 403 Forbidden
        else role permitted
            UC-->>CTRL: result
            CTRL-->>U: 200 / 201 success
        end
    end
